{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149700/extras/847b5310ba175b3040caed05d22d6477.poster.avif?t=1774208312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149700/extras/847b5310ba175b3040caed05d22d6477.webm?t=1774208312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149700/extras/847b5310ba175b3040caed05d22d6477.mp4?t=1774208312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamcore: Rabbit Hole</strong> is a meditative walk through unsettlingly familiar liminal spaces, inspired by dreamcore aesthetics and the image of the \u201cideal America\u201d of the 1980s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149700/extras/729f4012c0ca58bbd2bc5488672e609b.poster.avif?t=1774208312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149700/extras/729f4012c0ca58bbd2bc5488672e609b.webm?t=1774208312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149700/extras/729f4012c0ca58bbd2bc5488672e609b.mp4?t=1774208312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is a distinct place with its own atmosphere, architecture, and soundscape. Sometimes cozy, sometimes unsettling, but always slightly familiar\u2014like the memory of a dream or a place you feel you\u2019ve already been.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode \u2014 the tale of a person searching for the way back to reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax Mode \u2014 free wandering through dream worlds, with no goals or restrictions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who it\u2019s for:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >anyone tired of the hustle and noise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >anyone who needs to \u201cswitch off\u201d and just roam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fans of dreamcore, liminal spaces, and atmospheric walks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here, the dream ends only when you decide to wake up.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4149700?t=1774208312","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4149700?t=1774208312","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149700/b2267ee00c694c31d2b7f7fdfdac5af65ce9ae98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774208312","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149700/b2267ee00c694c31d2b7f7fdfdac5af65ce9ae98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774208312","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4161220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149700/extras/847b5310ba175b3040caed05d22d6477.poster.avif?t=1774208312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149700/extras/847b5310ba175b3040caed05d22d6477.webm?t=1774208312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati